{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-10-13 11:51:00', 'title': "ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP TO OPEN THE WORLD'S FIRST ZERO-ENERGY CRUISE TERMINAL", 'text': "THE NEW STATE-OF-THE-ART FACILITY IN TEXAS IS ON TRACK TO ACHIEVE LEED GOLD AND BE COMPLETELY SOLAR POWERED GALVESTON, TEXAS , OCT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP'S (NYSE:\xa0RCL) NEW GALVESTON TERMINAL, WHICH IS OPENING NOV. 9 , WILL BE THE FIRST CRUISE TERMINAL TO GENERATE 100% OF ITS NEEDED ENERGY THROUGH ON-SITE SOLAR PANELS. THIS MAKES THE TERMINAL, WHICH WILL BE USED BY THE COMPANY'S ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL BRAND, THE FIRST LEED ZERO ENERGY FACILITY IN THE WORLD."}